176@@@@1@@I told her that I was content to take her on her own terms, and I have been as good as my word.@@@@1@23@sid=11076@@
177@@@@1@@"Well we have been married now for a year, and very happy we have been.@@@@1@15@sid=11077@@
178@@@@1@@But about a month ago, at the end of June, I saw for the first time signs of trouble.@@@@1@19@sid=11078@@
