183@@@@1@@There is always a look of fear upon her face--a look as if she were waiting and expecting.@@@@1@18@sid=11083@@
184@@@@1@@But until she speaks, I can say nothing.@@@@1@8@sid=11086@@
185@@@@1@@Mind you, she is a truthful woman, Mr. Holmes, and whatever trouble there may have been in her past life it has been no fault of hers.@@@@1@27@sid=11087@@
