252@@@@1@@"What, the man who draws them?"@@@@1@6@sid=11154@@
253@@@@1@@"Yes, I saw him at his work.@@@@1@7@sid=11155@@
254@@@@1@@But I will tell you everything in order.@@@@1@8@sid=11156@@
