288@@@@1@@"Have you that fresh drawing?"@@@@1@5@sid=11192@@
289@@@@1@@"Yes, it is very short, but I made a copy of it, and here it is."@@@@1@16@sid=11193@@
290@@@@1@@Again he produced a paper.@@@@1@5@sid=11194@@
291@@@@1@@The new dance was in this form:@@@@1@7@sid=11195@@
292@@@@1@@GRAPHIC@@@@1@1@sid=11196@@
