297@@@@1@@It fills me with hopes.@@@@1@5@sid=11201@@
298@@@@1@@Now, Mr. Hilton Cubitt, please continue your most interesting statement."@@@@1@10@sid=11202@@
299@@@@1@@"I have nothing more to say, Mr. Holmes, except that I was angry with my wife that night for having held me back when I might have caught the skulking rascal.@@@@1@31@sid=11203@@
